category: Scheme
build-depends: cygport 
sdesc: "Minimal R7RS Scheme implementation (licensing & readmes)"
ldesc: "Chibi-Scheme is a very small library intended for use as an
extension and scripting language in C programs. It aims for fast startup, a
small footprint, and support for the R7RS standard."
skip:

homepage: https://github.com/ashinn/chibi-scheme
license: BSD-3-Clause AND MIT
